{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112033","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112033/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112033/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112033/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112033","id":3552635362,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vrpGH","number":112033,"title":"Fix `memnew_placement` with `char *` arguments","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1161726405,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTYxNzI2NDA1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/high%20priority","name":"high priority","color":"7956a5","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-25T15:33:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T18:36:39Z","closed_at":"2025-10-25T18:33:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112033","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112033.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112033.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-25T18:33:42Z"},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112022\r\n\r\nThis fixes an issue where `memnew_placement(some_char_ptr, 'c')` would not assign the new value correctly to `some_char_ptr`, instead allocating new memory.\r\n\r\nThis fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112022, because it's using a `Vector<char>`, which triggered the bug. In this case, the bug causes data loss, which makes this a high priority fix.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105928 triggered the issue because the refactor started to use `memnew_placement` with a `char *` argument (from `Vector<char>::push_back` in `ConservativeGetLine`), causing the regression.\r\n\r\nThis might also fix a few other obscure bugs.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\nWe have a few `new` overloads in `memory.h`.\r\nOne of them takes a `const char *` argument, which is meant to be the description (although unused as of now).\r\n\r\nWhen using `memnew_placement(some_char_ptr, 'c')`, it would call this overload by accident, because it matches better with the argument signature than `new(size_t, void *)`, which is the standard [placement new](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/new.html#Placement_new) overload.\r\nIn effect, this means that it would allocate new memory for a `char` instead of placing the char in the given memory.\r\nNotably, this bug has existed since Godot was made open source, and might have caused other so far unresolved bugs with `char` placement.\r\n\r\nThis PR works around the bug by providing a `char *` overload, which correctly calls the placement new version.\r\n\r\n## Alternative solution\r\n\r\nI initially tried to solve the issue by removing the unneeded `p_description` parameter, but this didn't work (crashing the editor on startup). This would be a better solution, and should be investigated in a follow-up. But it is not necessary to resolve the issue.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112033/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":6,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112033/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}